    "html": "<p class=\"lead-intro\" data-ke-size=\"size16\">서론</p>\n<p data-ke-size=\"size16\"><br /><br /></p>\n<section class=\"post-card\"><h2 data-ke-size=\"size26\">소제목</h2><div class=\"card-body\"><p data-ke-size=\"size16\">문단1.<br /><br />문단2.</p><ul data-ke-list-type=\"disc\"><li data-ke-size=\"size16\">포인트</li></ul><div class=\"summary-card\"><b>요약:</b> 핵심 한 문장</div></div></section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"post-card faq-card\"><h2 data-ke-size=\"size26\">자주 묻는 질문</h2><div class=\"card-body\"><div class=\"faq-item\"><p class=\"faq-q\" data-ke-size=\"size16\"><b>Q. 질문</b></p><p class=\"faq-a\" data-ke-size=\"size16\">A. 답변</p></div><p data-ke-size=\"size16\"><br /></p><div class=\"faq-item\">...</div></div></section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"post-card\"><h2 data-ke-size=\"size26\">결론</h2><div class=\"card-body\"><p data-ke-size=\"size16\">마무리</p><p data-ke-size=\"size16\">참고: <a href=\"출처URL\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">출처 제목</a></p></div></section>"
